Subject: Re: Testing measurement/structural invariance
Message-ID: <PYXBvwQ4vH0.OqEDpstxCQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PYXBvwQ4vH0.mibU8mezBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <PYXBvwQ4vH0.mibU8mezBgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
