> Can lavaan output the degrees of freedom from the model statement before it runs a model?

You can pass your syntax to lavaanify() to convert it to a parameter table, then pass that to the utility function lav_partable_df().  Note that you must either specify all free parameters in your model syntax, or tell lavaanify() to automatically free parameters that wrappers like cfa() and sem() do, using the auto* arguments.  For example:

example(cfa) # df = 24
lav_partable_df(lavaanify(HS.model, auto = TRUE)) # 24

